# Cheffinator Project Rules

## Project Overview
Cheffinator is a recipe management web app with a React frontend and Node.js/Express backend.

## Tech Stack
- Frontend: React (Vite), vanilla CSS-in-JS
- Backend: Node.js, Express
- Database: PostgreSQL (Neon)
- Hosting: Render.com
- Domain: cheffinator.com (Cloudflare DNS)

## Project Structure
```
Cheffinator webapp/
├── frontend/          # React app (Vite)
│   └── src/
│       ├── App.jsx    # Main app component
│       ├── api.js     # API calls
│       └── ImageCapture.jsx  # Camera/GIF capture
├── backend/           # Express server
│   └── server.js      # API routes + database
└── package.json       # Root scripts
```

## Git Workflow
- `main` branch → Production (cheffinator.com)
- Feature branches → Test on staging first
- Always test on mobile before merging

